n electron flow. Bottlenecks create pressure, friction, and heat. Gemstone capacitors bend the path of an electron with a lense so that the electrons must follow a longer path to reach their destination. This elongated path also acts as a buffer to contain electrons on this elongated path. This type of resistor acts as a capacitor.  Time crystals:  If a crystal elongates the path of an electron. Time is literally dialated for an electron within this path. An electron could travel for 1 hour in a crystal and from the outside of the crystal we would see it only 1 second after pressing a switch.","topics":[],"score":210814,"global_rank":270814},{"name":"mypetyak/debbuild","owner":"mypetyak","html_url":"https://github.com/mypetyak/debbuild","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Shell","description":"Build debian packages in a docker container","topics":[],"score":210813,"global_rank":270815},{"name":"kimparsons/skills-resolve-merge-conflicts","owner":"kimparsons","html_url":"https://github.com/kimparsons/skills-resolve-merge-conflicts","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":1,"language":"Other","description":"My clone repository","topics":[],"score":210812,"global_rank":270819},{"name":"UniKlo/42-C-ssl_md5","owner":"UniKlo","html_url":"https://github.com/UniKlo/42-C-ssl_md5","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C","description":null,"topics":[],"score":210804,"global_rank":270839},{"name":"UniKlo/42-C-fractal","owner":"UniKlo","html_url":"https://github.com/UniKlo/42-C-fractal","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C","description":null,"topics":[],"score":210804,"global_rank":270840},{"name":"iridescent-anupam/Data-Structures-in-C","owner":"iridescent-anupam","html_url":"https://github.com/iridescent-anupam/Data-Structures-in-C","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C","description":"Collection of a few Data Structure Questions in C","topics":["c","coding","data-structures"],"score":210804,"glo